  defaultStance: 2
  endings:
  - requiredFlags: []
    text: Sam finished school in Newhaven and still walks past the old town hall
      on the way home.
  - requiredFlags:
    - library_closed
    text: "With the library gone, Sam revised in caf\xE9s and on night buses, and
      still made the grades, just."
  - requiredFlags:
    - library_saved
    text: 'Evenings in the library paid off: Sam is the first in the family to go
      to university.'
  - requiredFlags:
    - library_reduced
    text: Three evenings a week in the library were enough. Sam is off to university
      in the autumn.
  - requiredFlags:
    - score_amended
    text: Thanks to the appeals office, Sam's family finally moved into a bigger
      flat on Riverside Street.
